; region_key_multi_adorn_1 -- ADJ-R3-A STRICT single-forcing scope (session
; 5; all-4-modes reject under the .drflags `-demand`): a bracket on a
; relation demanded under >=2 query adornments rejects REGARDLESS of which
; adornment the declared set matches -- one relation-scoped bracket has no
; single reconciliation referent across N disjoint inferred keys
; (unprovable-therefore-reject, RP-3). The demand_multi_adorn_witness twin
; WITHOUT the bracket compiles (D3.a.3); only the bracket is rejected here.
#message edge_2(u64 A, u64 B).
#local rel[A](u64 A, u64 B).
rel(A, B) : edge_2(A, B).
#query q(bound u64 A, free u64 B).
#query q(free u64 A, bound u64 B).
q(A, B) : rel(A, B).
